      "archaeologicalRemains": "traces",
      "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas and DARMC both place Ecobrogis at or near the village of\u00a0Sorsavu\u015f, K\u0131r\u0131kkale, according to the conjecture published in <em>TIB</em> 4, 105, n. 98. A different location has been proposed by Strobel 2002, 27 (<em>pace</em>\u00a0Y\u00f6r\u00fckan 2009, 151): a site between the villages of\u00a0Kalek\u0131\u015fla and\u00a0Fara\u015fl\u0131. The location of the archaeological site of\u00a0G\u00fcltepe H\u00f6y\u00fc\u011f\u00fc appears to fit that description. For photos, cf.\u00a0Y\u00f6r\u00fckan 2009, 151 and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.kulturportali.gov.tr/turkiye/kirikkale/kulturenvanteri/gultepe-hoyugu\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Turkish culture ministry website</a>.</p>",
      "review_state": "published",
      "accuracy_value": 20.0,
      "accuracy": "https://pleiades.stoa.org/features/metadata/generic-osm-accuracy-assessment",
      "featureType": [
        "settlement"
      ],
