  ],
  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: area of Sorsovus (=\u00a0Sorsavu\u015f, K\u0131r\u0131kkale). Eccobriga/Ekkobriga was one of the most important settlements of the Galatian tribal state of the Trocmi. See Strobel 2002, 27. Two different locations have been proposed. For\u00a0Sorsavu\u015f, K\u0131r\u0131kkale, see TIB 4, 105, n. 98; for a site associated with\u00a0Kalek\u0131\u015fla,\u00a0K\u0131r\u0131kkale, see both Strobel 2002, 27, and\u00a0Y\u00f6r\u00fckan 2009, 151. Google Maps shows photo of what seems to be <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/71900+Kalek%C4%B1%C5%9Fla+K%C3%B6y%C3%BC%2FSulakyurt%2FK%C4%B1r%C4%B1kkale,+Turkey/@40.1243449,33.8084842,3a,75y,90t/data=!3m8!1e2!3m6!1sAF1QipM_-xdAybnloMIOhLUEjhviU2YBReWXuz5BUN1p!2e10!3e12!6shttps:%2F%2Flh5.googleusercontent.com%2Fp%2FAF1QipM_-xdAybnloMIOhLUEjhviU2YBReWXuz5BUN1p%3Dw114-h86-k-no!7i4128!8i3096!4m5!3m4!1s0x408197d320ae1c71:0xb745e4f570e3ed6e!8m2!3d40.1243449!4d33.8084842\" target=\"_self\" title=\"the presumed site\">the presumed site</a>.</p>\r\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "A Galatian settlement founded on the road from Ancyra to Tavium; a statio on the Tabula Peutingeriana.",
